{"tmdb_id":198434,"title":"My Own","original_title":"Swaham","release_year":1994,"language_code":"ml","language_name":"マラヤーラム語","industry":"モリウッド","poster":null,"overview":"A widow's grief for her husband provides the focus in this tender Indian drama. Ramayyar was the joy of Ananpoorna's life. His recent death literally drained all color from Ananpoorna's life. The movie is a combination of her memories and her present situation. Before her husband died, the two owned a small cafe in Kerala, their home village. The remote little town is connected to the world by passing trains en route to the city of Trivandrum. When the funeral is finished, Ananpoorna finds herself destitute and unable to support her teenage son and daughter. To pay her debts, her cafe is sold and razed. Afterwards she moves in with her brother-in-law. Her son, Kannan, must decide whether to join the military, at the advice of the stationmaster, or join his friend who journeys to the Middle-East.","cast":[{"name":"Gopi","character":""},{"name":"Sharath Das","character":""},{"name":"Venmani Vishnu","character":""},{"name":"Venmani Haridas","character":""}],"songs":[{"title":"Do You Know Who I'm Looking At","url":"https://www.jiosaavn.com/song/do-you-know-who-im-looking-at/PjEhAhBYBwQ","singers":"Lilal Yalya"},{"title":"Hip-Hop Lyrics","url":"https://www.jiosaavn.com/song/hip-hop-lyrics/CDwMRwBeeUM","singers":"Yaguj Lamim"},{"title":"How to Live","url":"https://www.jiosaavn.com/song/how-to-live/BlskRzx4RFU","singers":"Ninir Ruman"},{"title":"I Still Love You","url":"https://www.jiosaavn.com/song/i-still-love-you/SQtdXA1CY2c","singers":"Yamia Mitir"},{"title":"I Wanna Be Your Man","url":"https://www.jiosaavn.com/song/i-wanna-be-your-man/EicyXEFCZHw","singers":"Yaman Nalul"},{"title":"I'm Gonna Roll With Ya","url":"https://www.jiosaavn.com/song/im-gonna-roll-with-ya/IwccBxx4Bnk","singers":"Nulil Miqna"},{"title":"I'm Not A Singer","url":"https://www.jiosaavn.com/song/im-not-a-singer/GjJZdxBAAlI","sing